_meanings:
A particle of interrogation or inquiry, often implying
 ‘doubt’, or ‘surprise’, and translatable by ‘what’, ‘hey’, ‘hallo’, ‘can
 it be that’. It is added to interrogative pronouns in this sense or to
 give an indefinite sense; {#kAsvidavaguRWanavatI nAtiparisPuwaSarIralAvaRyA#}
 <ls>Ś. 5. 13</ls>; <ls>Me. 14</ls>. It is sometimes used disjunctively in the sense of
 ‘either’, ‘or’, with {#nu, uta, vA#} <ab>&c.</ab>; {#sarojapatre nu vilInazawpade#}
 {#viloladfzweH svidamU vilocane . SiroruhAH svinnatapakzmasaMtaterdvirePavfndaM#}
